OL,3,AFans aim for Vulcan salute record on
OL,4,AStar Trek Day
OL,5,
OL,6,FGlyn Morgan, principal curator at the
OL,7,Fmuseum, said: "For 60 years, Star Trek
OL,8,Fhas connected bold storytelling with
OL,9,Fbig questions about science, technology
OL,10,Fand what might be possible in the
OL,11,Ffuture, themes that sit at the heart of
OL,12,Fthe Science Museum."
